{"product_id":"gid://shopify/Product/7266051096734","title":"Good Smile Company Pocket Maquette: Tokyo Revengers 02 (Set of 6) - Japanese Pvc Figure","old_description":"\n                \u003ch3\u003e Details: \u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n                \u003cli\u003e Brand: Good Smile Company\u003c/li\u003e\n                \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n                \u003cli\u003e Weight: 200g\u003c/li\u003e\n                \u003c/ul\u003e\n            ","new_description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eDescription\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cp\u003eThe Good Smile Company Pocket Maquette: Tokyo Revengers 02 (Set of 6) brings to life the beloved characters from the popular Tokyo Revengers series in a compact and collectible form. Each figure is crafted with meticulous attention to detail, capturing the unique personalities and styles of the characters in a charming PVC format. This set offers fans an opportunity to own a mini collection that showcases the dynamic cast in a durable and display-friendly design.\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003eManufactured by Good Smile Company, a renowned name in high-quality figures and collectibles, this set stands out for its vibrant colors and fine craftsmanship. The pocket-sized figures are perfect for both display at home or on the go, making them an excellent addition for collectors and fans of the series alike. Their pre-painted finish and sturdy construction ensure these figures are ready to impress right out of the box.\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eDetails\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e• Specifications:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e \u003cul style=\"margin-left: 20px;\"\u003e \u003cli\u003ePVC Figure\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003eSet of 6\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003ePre-painted\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003eCollectible\u003c/li\u003e \u003c/ul\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e• Condition:\u003c/strong\u003e New\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e• Product Material:\u003c/strong\u003e PVC\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e• Manufacturer:\u003c/strong\u003e Good Smile Company\u003c/p\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e• Recommended Age:\u003c/strong\u003e 15+\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cul\u003e \u003cli\u003eIncludes six detailed figures from Tokyo Revengers\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003eCompact pocket-sized design ideal for display or travel\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003ePre-painted with vibrant colors and fine detailing\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003eMade from durable PVC material\u003c/li\u003e \u003cli\u003ePerfect for collectors and fans of the series\u003c/li\u003e \u003c/ul\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"product-accordion-item\" data-accordion\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-header\" data-accordion-trigger\u003e \u003ch3\u003eCare instructions\u003c/h3\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv class=\"accordion-content\"\u003e \u003cp\u003eTo keep your figures looking their best, gently clean them with a soft, dry cloth to remove dust. Avoid using water or harsh chemicals that may damage the paint or material. Display the figures away from direct sunlight to prevent fading and discoloration. Handle with care to avoid breaking any delicate parts, and store them in a dust-free environment when not on display.\u003c/p\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e","c